{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"a3ef10b5-dbe3-4b52-9f26-0e614433ac3e","ts":"2026-06-08T12:03:10.614-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"15","nodeName":"NVIDIA NIM - Nemotron 3 Ultra (Backup 3)","workflowName":"N8N VIRALflow","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatNvidia","workflowId":"3tfWyS8s8CBL1RW1","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: Take the user input and output in the following JSON Structure, DO NOT change or alter any of the text.description should be short and should have hashtags.\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\",\\n  \\\"properties\\\": {\\n    \\\"Title\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Short and engaging title,under 50 characters\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Description\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"Simple Short hasrh truth description with key hashtags, hook, context, CTA, and hashtags.\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Hook\\\": {\\n      \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"hasrh truth hook mocking modern scientist\\\"\\n    },\\n  },\\n  \\\"required\\\": [\\\"Title\\\", \\\"Description\\\", \\\"Intro\\\", \\\"MainScript\\\"]\\n}\\nHuman: User Input:\\nWhat if I told you Hindus performed plastic surgery in 600 BCE while Europe still thought illness was demon possession? Sushruta documented nose reconstruction skin grafts anesthesia techniques in the Sushruta Samhita — over 2,500 years before modern medicine invented them British surgeons studied his texts in the 1800s then claimed the discoveries as their own Wait theres more — he described 121 surgical instruments and 300 procedures including cataract removal cesarean sections and dental implants Meanwhile Hippocrates gets credit for father of medicine despite writing centuries later with zero surgical detail This isnt mythology — its documented history they conveniently erased from textbooks Before they invented it — we documented it\\namazing world of cats\\nFacts: \\nYou must format your output as a JSON value that adheres to a given \\\"JSON Schema\\\" instance.\\n\\n\\\"JSON Schema\\\" is a declarative language that allows you to annotate and validate JSON documents.\\n\\nFor example, the example \\\"JSON Schema\\\" instance {{\\\"properties\\\": {{\\\"foo\\\": {{\\\"description\\\": \\\"a list of test words\\\", \\\"type\\\": \\\"array\\\", \\\"items\\\": {{\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}}}}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"foo\\\"]}}}}\\nwould match an object with one required property, \\\"foo\\\". The \\\"type\\\" property specifies \\\"foo\\\" must be an \\\"array\\\", and the \\\"description\\\" property semantically describes it as \\\"a list of test words\\\". The items within \\\"foo\\\" must be strings.\\nThus, the object {{\\\"foo\\\": [\\\"bar\\\", \\\"baz\\\"]}} is a well-formatted instance of this example \\\"JSON Schema\\\". The object {{\\\"properties\\\": {{\\\"foo\\\": [\\\"bar\\\", \\\"baz\\\"]}}}} is not well-formatted.\\n\\nYour output will be parsed and type-checked according to the provided schema instance, so make sure all fields in your output match the schema exactly and there are no trailing commas!\\n\\nHere is the JSON Schema instance your output must adhere to. Include the enclosing markdown codeblock:\\n```json\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"output\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"object\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"Title\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Short and engaging title, curiosity-driven.\\\"},\\\"Description\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Short description with key hashtags, hook, context, CTA, and hashtags.\\\"},\\\"Hook\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"string\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Introduction.\\\"}},\\\"required\\\":[\\\"Title\\\",\\\"Description\\\"],\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false}},\\\"additionalProperties\\\":false,\\\"$schema\\\":\\\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\\\"}\\n```\\n\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b\",\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"```json\\n{\\n  \\\"output\\\": {\\n    \\\"Title\\\": \\\"Ancient Indian Surgery Predates Modern Medicine by Millennia\\\",\\n    \\\"Description\\\": \\\"Sushruta documented plastic surgery, anesthesia, and 300+ procedures in 600 BCE — while Europe blamed demons. British surgeons stole his work in the 1800s. Textbooks erased this history. #Sushruta #AncientMedicine #HistoryErased #PlasticSurgery #KnowledgeTheft\\\",\\n    \\\"Hook\\\": \\\"What if I told you Hindus performed plastic surgery in 600 BCE while Europe still thought illness was demon possession?\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":680,\"promptTokens\":706,\"totalTokens\":1386}}}"}}
